Add `isILMAvailable` flag. When running on traditional version, isILMAvailable = true; when running on serverless (`yarn serverless-security`), isILMAvailable = false.

isILMAvailable is added to stats api as well. If isILMAvailable = false, it finds indices only in last 7 days and does an intersection with stats api.

